<% content_for :title, "Dear Journal | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="dear-journal-page">

  <style>
    .dear-journal-page {
      --dj-ink: #171717;
      --dj-paper: #fffdf3;
      --dj-blue-line: rgba(93, 145, 184, .32);
      --dj-pink: #ff1493;
      --dj-yellow: #eaff00;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 70px 22px 90px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 15%, rgba(138, 0, 255, .18), transparent 38%),
        #080808;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .dj-header {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto 38px;
    }

    .dj-eyebrow,
    .dj-meta,
    .dj-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .dj-eyebrow {
      color: var(--dj-pink);
    }

    .dj-header h1 {
      margin: 14px 0;
      font-size: clamp(52px, 9vw, 112px);
      line-height: .88;
      letter-spacing: -.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .dj-subtitle {
      color: var(--dj-yellow);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .dj-notebook {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-top: 34px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55));
    }

    /* Spiral binding */
    .dj-spiral {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 2;
      top: 0;
      left: 8%;
      right: 8%;
      height: 48px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #c5c5c5 0 22%, transparent 25%)
        0 0 / 42px 48px repeat-x;
    }

    .dj-paper {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 62px clamp(28px, 8vw, 82px) 70px;
      color: var(--dj-ink);
      background-color: var(--dj-paper);
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          transparent 0,
          transparent 54px,
          rgba(255, 20, 147, .58) 55px,
          rgba(255, 20, 147, .58) 57px,
          transparent 58px
        ),
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          to bottom,
          transparent 0,
          transparent 37px,
          var(--dj-blue-line) 38px,
          transparent 39px
        );
      border-radius: 3px 8px 8px 3px;
      box-shadow:
        inset 8px 0 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .08),
        4px 5px 0 #e7e2d1;
    }

    /* Notebook holes */
    .dj-paper::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 18px;
      width: 16px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle, #080808 0 5px, #d8d2c1 5.5px 7px, transparent 7.5px)
        center 18px / 16px 58px repeat-y;
    }

    .dj-date {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      background: var(--dj-yellow);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
    }

    .dj-greeting {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #8a00ff;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 48px);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .dj-copy {
      max-width: 690px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px);
      line-height: 1.95;
    }

    .dj-copy p {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    .dj-sticky {
      max-width: 530px;
      margin: 42px 0 34px auto;
      padding: 24px 26px;
      background: #eaff00;
      box-shadow: 5px 7px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .18);
      transform: rotate(1.5deg);
    }

    .dj-sticky .dj-label {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: #8a00ff;
    }

    .dj-sticky p {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .dj-links-heading {
      margin: 52px 0 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .dj-bookmarks {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .dj-bookmarks a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border: 2px solid #171717;
      color: #171717;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
    }

    .dj-bookmarks a:hover {
      background: #171717;
      color: var(--dj-paper);
    }

    .dj-back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 38px;
      color: #171717;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .dj-back:hover {
      color: #8a00ff;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .dear-journal-page {
        padding: 48px 14px 60px;
      }

      .dj-header {
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .dj-notebook {
        padding-top: 28px;
      }

      .dj-spiral {
        height: 42px;
        background-size: 36px 42px;
      }

      .dj-paper {
        padding: 52px 22px 48px 52px;
        background-position: 0 0, 0 0;
      }

      .dj-paper::before {
        left: 12px;
      }

      .dj-sticky {
        margin: 34px 0 28px;
        padding: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>


  <header class="dj-header">
    <p class="dj-eyebrow">BIPOLAR SOBER / PERSONAL NOTES</p>

    <h1>
      DEAR<br>
      JOURNAL.
    </h1>

    <p class="dj-subtitle">
      A place to put the pieces.
    </p>
  </header>


  <article class="dj-notebook">
    <div class="dj-spiral" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="dj-paper">

      <p class="dj-date">A NOTE TO MYSELF</p>

      <div class="dj-copy">
        <p class="dj-greeting">Dear Journal,</p>

        <p>
          This is the place where I say it all. Well, maybe not everything, 
          but a lot of it. It's not a neat little story, I'm no hero, and
          most pages are just jibberish. It's me, and that's all there is here.
          There's nothing else. Just me.
        </p>

        <p>
        I've seen too much in my opinion, and I'm tired of it. Time to settle,
        and the advice to do so is all right here. All I have to do is just
        listen. See the world, live fully, and stay sober. The world is brighter
        with sobriety. You're at 99 days as you write this, and it's been an
        awesome 99 days. Keep going.
        </p>

        <p>
          Love,
          <br>
          Mel
        </p>

      </div>

      <aside class="dj-sticky">
        <p class="dj-label">REMINDER</p>
        <p>
          You do not have to be polished, finished, or figured out
          before you belong.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <p class="dj-links-heading">Flip to a section</p>

      <nav class="dj-bookmarks" aria-label="Journal sections">
        <%= link_to "Bipolar", bipolar_path %>
        <%= link_to "Addiction", addiction_path %>
        <%= link_to "Toolbox", toolbox_path %>
        <%= link_to "Perspectives", perspectives_path %>
        <%= link_to "Spirituality", spirituality_path %>
      </nav>

      <%= link_to "← BACK HOME", root_path, class: "dj-back" %>

    </div>
  </article>

</main>